WEBVTT

NOTE Logistics weekly, 21 October 2026. Attendees: Sofia Marchetti, Mateo Fischer, Aylin Demir.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Sofia Marchetti>Okay, logistics weekly. Aylin, start with inbound freight for this week.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:19.000
<v Aylin Demir>Inbound is mostly on time. Two trucks from Rahmenbau Nord came in on Monday, both with the full frame count and the right paperwork.

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
<v Sofia Marchetti>Good. And the motors?

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
<v Aylin Demir>Motors are fine. One pallet arrived with a damaged corner, so I photographed it and sent the claim to the carrier.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:44.000
<v Mateo Fischer>I will chase the carrier on the claim tomorrow. It should not hold up the build.

6
00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v Sofia Marchetti>Thanks. Amsterdam warehouse next. Aylin, how is the space looking?

7
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:03.000
<v Aylin Demir>Tight. We have the spring stock still on the back racks, so the front bays are full of accessories and the new boxes are stacking on the floor.

8
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:11.000
<v Sofia Marchetti>Can we move the accessories to the mezzanine?

9
00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:20.000
<v Aylin Demir>Yes, if we do it on a Thursday. The mezzanine crew is only in on Thursdays.

10
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:27.000
<v Sofia Marchetti>Then book the Thursday. Mateo, what is the pallet situation?

11
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:39.000
<v Mateo Fischer>We are short on euro pallets. The carrier kept about forty of ours on their side after the last drop, and we have not got them back yet.

12
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:46.000
<v Sofia Marchetti>Can we buy some to cover the gap?

13
00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:57.000
<v Mateo Fischer>We can, but I would rather get the returns back first. Buying costs more than the claim will recover, so let us push the carrier for the pallets before we spend.

14
00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:04.000
<v Aylin Demir>I will send them the pallet list today so they can check their yard.

15
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:12.000
<v Sofia Marchetti>Good. Any outbound issues for dealers this week?

16
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:22.000
<v Aylin Demir>Two dealer orders were split because one bike was held at the final check. Both went out Wednesday, so nothing is late.

17
00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:30.000
<v Sofia Marchetti>Fine. Let us keep the check list tight at the dock until the pallets are back.

18
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.000
<v Mateo Fischer>Agreed. I will send the summary to the operations channel after this.
